      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA GOLD (8) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 29.95 beating ROCKY RACCOON. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. JACKPOT JUNIOR (5) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (24.23) in a Grade 5 over 407m at this track. Expected to bounce back to best. SPEAKEASY (7) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten 3.5 lengths (30.08). Goes well here including a win and seven minors. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can feature again. ROCKY RACCOON (4) scored last time and can measure up again.",
